# rasayan — src/mapk.cyr: Rust 1.2.0's MAPK cascade tests, ported
# Stdlib auto-included via cyrius.cyml
#
# The 17 unit tests of `mapk.rs` and the 2 integration tests (tests/integration.rs) that call only the cascade, as
# they are written; tests/golden/mapk.tsv checks every method, single tick, sub-step boundary and trajectory besides.
# Beyond them: the trace event and every codec's round trip.

